Requirements to run Borealies

- python (version >= 3.8.10)
- numpy version (>=1.22.3)
- yaml (version >= 5.3.1)
- mpi4py (version >= 3.0.3)
- bayesian-optimization (version >= 3.0; only for Bayesian optimization. It replaces GPyOpt from Borealis 1.7.0)
- matplotlib (optional; only for the convergence image of Bayesian optimization and the figures of the report)

(versions used in the developer's environment)


** The Python standard libraries used in the program **
os
shutil
subproces
sys
time
wraps
(argparse)


** Examples to update libraries **
python3 -m pip install --upgrade numpy
python3 -m pip install --upgrade yaml